G3049.def:
**λογίζομαι**
(λόγος), [in LXX chiefly for חָשַׁב ;]
1. prop., of numerical calculation, **to count, reckon**: with accusative before μετά, [[Mrk.15.23|Mrk.15:23]] (LXX) (Rec., R, mg.), [[Luk.22.37|Luk.22:37]]
2. Metaphorical, without reference to numbers, by a reckoning of characteristics or reasons;
(a) **to reckon, take into account**: with accusative of thing(s), [[1Co.13.5|1Co.13:5]] id. before dative of person(s), [[Rom.4.3|Rom.4:3]] (LXX), [[Rom.4.4, 6; 4.8|Rom.4:4, 6 4:8]]" (LXX), [[2Co.5.19|2Co.5:19]], [[2Ti.4.16|2Ti.4:16]]; before εἰς (cf. _Heb._ ל חָשַׁב; Bl., § 33, 3), [[Act.19.27|Act.19:27]], [[Rom.2.26; 4.3, 5; 4.9-11, 22-24; 9.8|Rom.2:26 4:3, 5 4:9-11, 22-24 9:8]] [[Gal.3.6|Gal.3:6]]" (LXX), [[Jas.2.23|Jas.2:23]] (LXX);
(b) **to consider, calculate**: with accusative of thing(s), [[Php.4.8|Php.4:8]] before ὅτι, [[Jhn.11.50|Jhn.11:50]], [[Heb.11.10|Heb.11:10]]; τοῦτο, ὅτι, [[2Co.10.11|2Co.10:11]] with accusative of person(s), with inf., [[Rom.6.11|Rom.6:11]] before ὡς, [[Rom.8.36|Rom.8:36]] (LXX);
(with) **to suppose, judge, deem**: [[1Co.13.11|1Co.13:11]] ὡς, [[1Pe.5.12|1Pe.5:12]] οὕτως, [[1Co.4.1|1Co.4:1]] with accusative of thing(s), [[2Co.3.5|2Co.3:5]] id. before εἰς, [[2Co.12.6|2Co.12:6]] ὅτι, [[Rom.8.18|Rom.8:18]] τοῦτο, ὅτι, [[Rom.2.3|Rom.2:3]], [[2Co.10.7|2Co.10:7]]; with inf., [[2Co.11.5|2Co.11:5]] accusative and inf., [[Rom.3.28; 14.14|Rom.3:28 14:14]], [[Php.3.13|Php.3:13]]; with accusative of person(s) before ὡς, [[2Co.10.2|2Co.10:2]]
(d) **to purpose, decide**: with inf. (Eur., Or., 555), [[2Co.10.2|2Co.10:2]]
(cf. ἀνα-, δια-, παρα-, συλ-λογίζομαι).†
(AS)
